WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.210
Someone strikes you on the cheek.

2
00:00:02.260 --> 00:00:03.840
What do you do next?

3
00:00:03.890 --> 00:00:08.720
In the Sermon on the Mount, Jesus says:
whoever strikes you on your right cheek,

4
00:00:08.770 --> 00:00:10.990
turn to him the other also.

5
00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:13.830
Peter asks how often he must forgive.

6
00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:15.150
Seven times?

7
00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:18.340
Jesus says: seventy times seven.

8
00:00:18.390 --> 00:00:21.850
And Jesus goes further
still: love your enemies,

9
00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:24.350
and pray for those who persecute you.

10
00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:26.960
Can anyone really live like that?

11
00:00:27.010 --> 00:00:30.370
In this mission, you'll read
what Jesus taught about anger,

12
00:00:30.420 --> 00:00:33.320
revenge and enemies, and why.

13
00:00:33.370 --> 00:00:36.400
Then you'll meet a servant
let off a huge debt,

14
00:00:36.450 --> 00:00:38.720
who would not let off a tiny one.

15
00:00:38.770 --> 00:00:42.680
Your mission: weigh up whether
anyone can really live like that.
